diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1a55755..03f6537 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,7 +6,15 @@ In-memory inventory service. `api.handle(request)` maps a request
 
 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": "..." | null}`: one page of
+  items, ordered by `id` ascending. Query parameters:
+  - `limit` (optional): integer 1..100, default 20.
+  - `cursor` (optional): the `next_cursor` value from a previous response.
+    Treat it as opaque and pass it back unchanged.
+  - `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page. Walk all pages by requesting
+    with each returned cursor until it is `null`.
+  - 400 `{"error": "..."}` when `limit` is not an integer or is outside 1..100,
+    or when `cursor` is not one this service issued.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
